## 🧪 Verify Deployment

### Test Storage Account
```bash
STORAGE_ACCOUNT=$(terraform output -raw storage_account_name)

# List containers
az storage container list --account-name $STORAGE_ACCOUNT --auth-mode login

# Upload a test file
echo "Test file" > test.txt
az storage blob upload \
  --account-name $STORAGE_ACCOUNT \
  --container-name bronze-layer \
  --name test/test.txt \
  --file test.txt \
  --auth-mode login
```

### Test Event Hubs
```bash
EVENTHUBS_NS=$(terraform output -raw eventhubs_namespace_name)

# List Event Hubs
az eventhubs eventhub list --namespace-name $EVENTHUBS_NS --resource-group $(terraform output -raw resource_group_name)

# View Event Hub details
az eventhubs eventhub show \
  --namespace-name $EVENTHUBS_NS \
  --name evh-quickbuy-orders-dev \
  --resource-group $(terraform output -raw resource_group_name)
```

